    "By code: more predictable and deterministic.\n",
    "\n",
    "By LLMs: more powerful.\n",
    "\n",
    "An excellent write-up is here:\n",
    "\n",
    "https://openai.github.io/openai-agents-python/multi_agent/\n",
    "\n",
    "We will start with by Code."
